        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Jason",
        "ActorTalk": "Maru Bear, on the other hand, can move much more freely.",
        "Cv": 520005076.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Jason",
        "ActorTalk": "And would be a great partner in carrying out our countermeasures.",
        "Cv": 520005077.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "Jason",
        "ActorTalk": "The Commercial District's mascot, hired by Ross. Its firmware upgrade should be complete any moment now.",
